	MIN(Share of Working Pop in Labor Pool,Maximum Share of Working Pop in Labor Pool)
	~	Percent
	~		|

Initial Share of Work Pop in Labor Pool=
	60
	~	Percent
	~		|

Share of Working Pop in Labor Pool=
	Normal Share of Working Pop in Labor Pool*Effect of Chg in Unemployment on Labor Pool
	~	Percent
	~		|

Time to Adjust Norm Share of Work Pop in Labor Pool=
	2
	~	Years
	~		|

Effect of Chg in Unemployment on Labor Pool=
	2*(Max Eff of Chg in Unemploy on Labor Pool-1)/(1+exp((Expected Chg in Unemployment)\
		*Sensitivity of Labor Pool to Chg in Unemployment))+(2-Max Eff of Chg in Unemploy on Labor Pool\
		)
	~	Dimensionless
	~		|

Normal Share of Working Pop in Labor Pool= INTEG (
	Adj of Norm Share of Work Pop in Labor Pool,
		Initial Share of Work Pop in Labor Pool)
	~	Percent
	~		|

Expectations Adjustment Unemployment=
	(Change in Unemployment Rate - Expected Chg in Unemployment)/Time to Adjust Expectations UE
	~	(Fraction/Year)/Year
	~		|

Reference Unemployment Rate= INTEG (
