	~	Percent
	~		|

Change in Unemployment Rate=
	(Perceived Unemployment Rate - Reference Unemployment Rate)/Reference Unemployment Rate\
		/Time Horizon to Assess Unemployment
	~	Fraction/Year
	~		|

